---
import ArticleLayout from '../../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro';
import metadata from './metadata';
---
<ArticleLayout metadata={metadata}>
  <p>Bring your own software factory. Instead of bending every task around someone else's
    enormous app, make a small tool that does exactly the thing you keep putting off.
    A script to sort the mess, a page to track the project, a button that saves five
    annoying clicks. The interesting part isn't how much software you can produce;
    it's how little you need to make the day feel easier.</p>
</ArticleLayout>
